  "body": "Different websites use the same HID device, oninputreport only trigger one of the listeners\r\n\r\nHow can I make oninputreport trigger both?\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\n// A application\r\nHIDScanner.oninputreport = (e) => {\r\n  console.log(\"A\")\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\n// B application\r\nHIDScanner.oninputreport = (e) => {\r\n  console.log(\"B\")\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\nFirst scan:\r\n\r\n\"A\" triggerd\r\n\r\nSecond scan:\r\n\r\n\"B\" triggerd",
